{
  "about": [
    "Canon EOS cameras that write CR2/CR3, embedded in the plugin. Looked up by the model name NINA's Canon driver reports.",
    "model / aliases: every name the camera is sold or reports itself under (spacing, case, hyphens, 'Canon', 'EOS', 'Digital' and 'Mark II'/'m2'/'II' spellings do not matter).",
    "Pixel size = sensorWidthMm * 1000 / effectiveWidth (Canon's published sensor width and effective image width).",
    "decodedWidth x decodedHeight = the image NINA decodes from the camera's RAW file (NINA's own FreeImage/LibRaw, RAW_UNPROCESSED cropped to Raw.Frame). 0 x 0 = unknown: the plugin takes it from the camera's first frame.",
    "To add a camera see tools/sensor-table/README.md."
  ],
